            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Cardiovascular diseases are the leading cause of death in most industrialised countries. In France, they are responsible for 142,000 deaths every year. Myocardial infarction and coronary deaths are also falling, but could rise for women in the future. There are different forms of prevention and lifestyles are important.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
